    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No.8, Stone Court is a beautifully maintained and fully renovated 3-bedroom apartment with parking (122 Sq.M / 1313 Sq.Ft) ideally situated just off the Lower Glanmire Road, Cork City. Presented in excellent condition, the property has been modernised to a high standard and offers bright, well-proportioned and comfortable accommodation throughout. Stonecourt is a well-established development comprising just 20 apartments and is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to trade down to a more manageable home.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an exceptionally convenient location, with a bus stop directly outside the complex and a convenience store immediately next door. Cork City Centre is approximately a 5-minute drive away, while the property location also provides easy access to the Lower Glanmire Road and wider road network. Combining its turnkey condition, generous 3-bedroom accommodation and excellent accessibility, No. 8, Stonecourt represents an attractive opportunity to acquire a modern home in a highly convenient Cork City location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor \r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway – polished timber floor, built in bookcase. \r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen / Living Area \r\n\r\nKitchen - floor and eye level fitted units with integrated appliances and quartz worktops, kitchen island with storage and feature pendant lighting overhead. Living area – built in fitted shelving, feature windows, polished timber floor. \r\n\r\nUtility Room - Fully plumbed for washing machine and dryer, floor and eye level fitted units, WC, WHB, tiled flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – Double bedroom, dual aspect windows, carpet floor covering.\r\nEn-suite with walk in shower, WC, WHB, heated towel rail \r\n\r\nBedroom 3/Office – Double bedroom, carpet floor covering. Currently laid out as home office with built in shelving. \r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1/ Master Suite – Master bedroom, carpet floor covering, east and west facing balconies, feature south-facing window. \r\n\r\nDressing Room Area – full length fitted robe units. \r\n\r\nEnsuite - Tiled floor, corner shower, WHB, WC, heated towel rail."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• BER B\r\n• Private gated complex of 20 apartments \r\n• Assigned parking space\r\n• Double Glazed Windows\r\n• Bright & airy atmosphere\r\n• Immaculate throughout"
      },
